      <div class="col-md-4 ai-group">
        <div class="clearfix">
          <div class="ai-icon-cont">
            <img class="icon" src="https://healthcare.e-zest.com/hubfs/Healthcare_Microsite/Icons/ai-file.gif" alt="Icon">
          </div>
          <div class="desc-cont">
            <h4>AI-Driven Value-Based Care</h4>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#AI-DrivenValue-BasedCare">
              Explore
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- The Modal -->
        <div class="modal fade explore-modal" id="AI-DrivenValue-BasedCare">
          <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
            <div class="modal-content">

              <!-- Modal Header -->
              <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="modal-title">
                  <button type="button" class="goback" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                  AI-Driven Value-Based Care
                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p>Value-based care is a transformative approach that prioritizes patient outcomes, cost-effectiveness, collaborative care and coordination, and quality in healthcare delivery. This model is particularly effective in managing chronic diseases and reducing hospital readmissions while emphasizing preventive care, population health management, and patient engagement. It has shown promising results in terms of improved patient outcomes and cost savings. By shifting the focus from volume to value, this approach is driving the transformation of healthcare delivery towards a patient-centered and quality-driven system.</p>
<p>e-Zest's has years of experience in providing pointed solutions and services while continually emphasizing on VALUE. We believe that value is created through transformation, hence, our approach to value-based Care is through transformative technologies like AI.</p>
e-Zest provides the following AI &amp; Generative AI services to optimize Value-Based Care:<br>
<ul>
<li>Data Analytics: AI can analyze large volumes of patient data, electronic health records, and other healthcare information to identify patterns, predict outcomes, and optimize treatment plans. This enables healthcare providers to make data-driven decisions and tailor care plans for individual patients, ultimately improving value-based care</li>
<li>Predictive Analytics: AI algorithms can predict the risk of certain diseases or complications based on patient data, facilitating early intervention and preventive measures. This helps healthcare providers proactively manage population health and allocate resources efficiently</li>
<li>Personalized Medicine: Generative AI can generate patient-specific treatment plans by considering individual characteristics, genetic information, and medical history. This supports precision medicine approaches, ensuring that patients receive the most appropriate and effective care for their unique needs</li>
<li>Decision Support Systems: AI-powered decision support systems can assist healthcare providers in making evidence-based treatment decisions by providing real-time clinical guidelines, research findings, and patient-specific recommendations. This promotes the delivery of high-quality, value-based care</li>
<li>Remote Monitoring and Telehealth: AI technologies enable remote patient monitoring, allowing healthcare providers to track patients' vital signs, symptoms, and adherence to treatment plans. This facilitates proactive interventions, reduces hospital readmissions, and improves patient outcomes, particularly in value-based care models</li>
<li>Workflow Optimization: AI can automate routine administrative tasks, streamline workflows, and reduce administrative burden for healthcare professionals. This allows them to spend more time on patient care, enhancing the overall quality and efficiency of value-based care delivery</li>
<li>Fraud Detection: AI algorithms can analyze healthcare claims and identify patterns of fraud, waste, and abuse. This helps in preventing fraudulent activities, optimizing resource allocation, and ensuring that healthcare funds are used appropriately, supporting the sustainability of value-based care models.</li>
</ul>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-md-4 ai-group">
        <div class="clearfix">
          <div class="ai-icon-cont">
            <img class="icon" src="https://healthcare.e-zest.com/hubfs/Healthcare_Microsite/Icons/Contract%20Management.gif" alt="Icon">
          </div>
          <div class="desc-cont">
            <h4>Account Management</h4>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#AccountManagement">
