                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p><strong>We provide cutting-edge digital solutions to help you excel in your role as a PBM Account Manager/Client Success Manager/Client Relationship Manager.</strong></p>
<p>Are you struggling with CSAT scores, SLA management, PGs, audits, benefit management, accuracy, spreads, and rebates?</p>
<ul>
<li>Our digital platform offers a Single Source of Truth, allowing Client Benefit Users and User Groups to easily manage their benefits. Whether it's adding, changing, or deleting benefits, our portal streamlines the process and enables effective benefit renewal. It eliminates manual tasks and allows you to embrace a more efficient way of managing benefits</li>
<li>To simplify your day-to-day operations, our platform also provides intuitive dashboards that offer real-time projections of spreads &amp; rebate. With this valuable information at your fingertips, you can confidently communicate with client teams, ensuring transparency and accurate reporting. The dashboards give you the insights you need to make data-driven decisions and provide exceptional service to your clients</li>
<li>Our platform includes claims surveillance capabilities as well. It sends notifications about possible differences and anomalies, allowing you to track and address issues promptly. Effective communication and triage become easy using these centralized digital tools</li>
</ul>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-md-4 ai-group">
        <div class="clearfix">
          <div class="ai-icon-cont">
            <img class="icon" src="https://healthcare.e-zest.com/hubfs/Healthcare_Microsite/Icons/Digital%20Contract%20Managemnet.gif" alt="Icon">
          </div>
          <div class="desc-cont">
            <h4>Digital Contract Management</h4>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#DigitalContractManagement">
              Explore
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- The Modal -->
        <div class="modal fade explore-modal" id="DigitalContractManagement">
          <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
            <div class="modal-content">

              <!-- Modal Header -->
              <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="modal-title">
                  <button type="button" class="goback" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                  Digital Contract Management
                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p><strong>Still using spreadsheets to manage your contracts, quotes, pricing models, renewals, and more?</strong></p>
<p>The possibility of seamlessly transitioning all your Excel-based processes to a modern digital contract management portal can save significant amount of time and resources. This transformation can be achieved effortlessly and quickly using e-Zest's innovative accelerator. This tool empowers you to harness the full potential of a digital contract management portal in no time.</p>
<p>With this cutting-edge technology, you can convert all your existing Excel spreadsheets into web-based solutions, ensuring a smooth transition and eliminating the need for manual data entry. It can quickly migrate your data, formulas, and functionalities from Excel to the web, all while preserving the integrity and accuracy of your information.</p>
<p>With this modern solution, you'll gain access to an array of powerful features, including automated alerts to remind you of important contract milestones, insightful analytics to optimize your pricing models, and a wide range of customizable options to tailor contracts to specific needs. Furthermore, this portal can streamline the entire contract lifecycle, from creation to negotiation, execution, and renewal.</p>
<p>Embrace the future of contract management and unlock a new level of efficiency and convenience.</p>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-md-4 ai-group">
        <div class="clearfix">
          <div class="ai-icon-cont">
            <img class="icon" src="https://healthcare.e-zest.com/hubfs/Healthcare_Microsite/Icons/Medicare%20start%20rating.gif" alt="Icon">
          </div>
          <div class="desc-cont">
            <h4>Star Rating &amp; Performance Reports</h4>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#StarRatingPerformanceReports">
              Explore
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- The Modal -->
        <div class="modal fade explore-modal" id="StarRatingPerformanceReports">
          <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
            <div class="modal-content">

              <!-- Modal Header -->
              <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="modal-title">
                  <button type="button" class="goback" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                  Star Rating &amp; Performance Reports
                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p>The Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS) provides Appeals and Grievances (A&amp;G) rights to members and providers associated with a health plan in the Medicare system. This process has a substantial impact on the Medicare Stars Rating System, which measures the quality and performance of Medicare Advantage (MA) plans. All 28 measures, included in the MA plan Stars Rating system, have an associated weight that varies from 1 to 5 in value. The higher the weight, the more the impact of that measure on the MA plan Stars rating. The total weight of all 28 measures was 67. A&amp;G directly or indirectly impact 9 of these 28 measures. These 9 measures have an aggregated weight of 36, which means A&amp;G process has an over 50% (36 out of 67) impact on the overall Medicare Stars Rating.</p>
<p>Optimizing the A&amp;G process, leveraging technology solutions, and focusing on member satisfaction and timely resolution of appeals and grievances are crucial for improving the Medicare Stars Rating of MA plans.</p>
<p>To learn more about how to efficiently execute the A&amp;G process to maintain and improve Medicare Stars Ratings,</p>
<p><!--HubSpot Call-to-Action Code -->
<span class="hs-cta-wrapper" id="hs-cta-wrapper-9a9ad79a-39b5-4e25-a3f6-b108d21b4150"><span class="hs-cta-node hs-cta-9a9ad79a-39b5-4e25-a3f6-b108d21b4150" id="hs-cta-9a9ad79a-39b5-4e25-a3f6-b108d21b4150">
