      <div class="col-md-4 ai-group">
        <div class="clearfix">
          <div class="ai-icon-cont">
            <img class="icon" src="https://healthcare.e-zest.com/hubfs/prescription.gif" alt="Icon">
          </div>
          <div class="desc-cont">
            <h4>Medicare Prescription Payment Plan</h4>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#MedicarePrescriptionPaymentPlan">
              Explore
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- The Modal -->
        <div class="modal fade explore-modal" id="MedicarePrescriptionPaymentPlan">
          <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
            <div class="modal-content">

              <!-- Modal Header -->
              <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="modal-title">
                  <button type="button" class="goback" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                  Medicare Prescription Payment Plan
                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p>The Inflation Reduction Act (IRA) has introduced significant enhancements to Medicare Part D, aimed at improving accessibility, affordability, transparency, and quality of care for beneficiaries. <strong>e-Zest PBM Center of Excellence</strong> offers a comprehensive suite of services to help organizations navigate these changes seamlessly.</p>
<p>Some of our key offerings include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Leveraging our Audit and Certification expertise to ensuring compliance with the Medicare Prescription Payment Plan (M3P)&nbsp;</li>
<li>Helping beneficiaries spread out-of-pocket costs evenly throughout the year while opting for M3P</li>
<li>Accurate claims adjudication to expand coverage options and reduce financial burdens through our Claims Testing services&nbsp;</li>
<li>Providing real-time insights into medication costs with our Claims Monitoring expertise&nbsp;</li>
<li>Facilitating integration of pricing information to empower cost-effective decision-making</li>
<li>Supporting implementation of medication therapy management programs</li>
<li>Aligning adherence initiatives with M3P requirements</li>
<li>Streamlining administrative procedures within the M3P with our IT Development expertise&nbsp;</li>
<li>Identifying and rectifying potential administrative inefficiencies with our Claims Monitoring Services</li>
</ul>
<p>e-Zest PBM Center of Excellence positions itself as a trusted partner to help organizations harness the full potential of Medicare Part D improvements, driving operational efficiency and delivering enhanced care to beneficiaries.</p>
<p><!--HubSpot Call-to-Action Code -->
