                <h4 class="modal-title">
                  <button type="button" class="goback" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                  Prescription Savings Program
                </h4>
                <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">×</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Modal body -->
              <div class="modal-body">
                <p>e-Zest – An Accion Labs Company, is leading the way in developing innovative Prescription Savings Programs, specifically tailored for Pharmacy Benefit Managers (PBMs), Health plans, and Employers. Our expert team brings deep subject matter expertise, ensuring we create top-tier applications designed to reduce prescription costs while maintaining member adherence.</p>
<p>We specialize in building robust applications for various Prescription Savings Programs, including:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Patient Assistance Programs</strong></li>
<li><strong>Copay Assistance Programs&nbsp;</strong></li>
<li><strong>International Pharmacy Programs</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>Patient Assistance Programs bridge the financial gap between members’ needs and support, ensuring they have access to necessary medications. Through our Copay Assistance Programs, we help members maximize their savings on brand-name medications, making high-cost prescriptions more affordable. International Pharmacy Programs are aimed at providing access to high-quality medications at significantly lower prices, broadening the options available to members.</p>
<p>Partnering with us means leveraging our extensive industry knowledge and technology expertise to develop and manage these critical Prescription Savings Programs. We can help transform prescription savings and enhance member adherence through innovative, effective, and affordable healthcare solutions.</p>
<p>Our expertise ensures your organization delivers unparalleled savings and adherence solutions, ultimately benefiting both members and the overall healthcare system.</p>
